WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.952
According to stories passed down by early Muslims, Adam and Hawa came from Paradise down to the earth.

2
00:00:06.352 --> 00:00:12.952
They were apart for a long, long time, searching for each other, until at last they met again.

3
00:00:13.352 --> 00:00:20.600
Hawa had many children. The children grew up and started their own families. Humans spread across the earth and moved to different places.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:33.048
Qabil and Habil each made an offering to Allah. Habil gave his very best sheep, but Qabil gave poor crops. A light from heaven came down and accepted Habil's offering.

5
00:00:33.448 --> 00:00:40.768
Qabil was blinded by jealousy. He pushed his brother down. His brother fell to the ground and never got up again.

6
00:00:41.168 --> 00:00:49.280
Qabil felt sorry and helpless. Then Allah sent a crow. It scratched the ground with its claws, showing him how to bury his brother.

7
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:59.688
Jealousy makes people do terrible things. Life is a gift from Allah, precious and sacred. When you make a mistake, repent sincerely, just like Adam did.
